Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,One of is muscle sparing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:04.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,This idea that you could do\Na shoulder replacement or a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:06.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,joint replacement and you\Nwouldn't have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,to cut the muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Subscapularis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:10.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,For example, the\Nsubscapularis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:13.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the subscap's in the\Nfront of your shoulder,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:17.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,The subscap, if you cut into\Nit, needs to heal,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:19.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,like any other muscle you\Ndo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:21.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,and that's a restriction for\Nsix weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:24.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,and it sometimes can lead to\Nlifelong problems, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:26.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,So imagine if I did a\Nshoulder replacement
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:29.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,without cutting that muscle\Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,First of all, you have no\Nrestrictions to start,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:34.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,you get back to work, you\Nhave no limitations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,and then you can get back to\Ndoing things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:38.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,and you don't have that risk\Nof it failing down the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:39.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:41.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the fact that we've even\Ndeveloped techniques
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:42.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,to be able to do so like\Nthat,
